# Hook, Line, and Sinker (jeuno 71): the available check's CoP edge. A level 75 Warrior, CoP A Vessel Without a Captain
# current (318), an Egret Fishing Rod: Omer's default 206; The Road Forks (325; a GM, A Vessel Without a Captain
# completed first: addMission refuses to overwrite a current mission): the rod traded while the quest is only
# available: no onTrade: nothing (the rod kept); 10040, begun.
lists LowerJeuno/Omer/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Omer/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10040
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-85,0,-119.8 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop AVesselWithoutACaptain current
item EgretFishingRod
login
trigger Omer                            # 318: no section; 206
finish
mission Cop AVesselWithoutACaptain completed # a GM: the log's current mission cleared
mission Cop TheRoadForks current        # a GM
trade Omer EgretFishingRod x1     # available: no onTrade: nothing
trigger Omer                            # 10040
finish                                  # begun
